1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,925
Add a paper to Papol from its PDF in the Library.

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:09,950
Drop it here, or click the upload area
and choose the file.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:15,100
Papol extracts the metadata.
Review it before saving.

4
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:30,250
By default, every account has two shelves: one called Display,
and the other called Personal. Each paper inherits the visibility
of its shelf: Display is public; Personal is private.

5
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,975
A paper can have multiple private tags.

6
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:39,550
Summaries are private;
thoughts and ratings public.

7
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:44,050
Then save the paper.

8
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:47,325
Open it, and choose Read.

9
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:50,675
Enjoy Papol.
